{"id":"n16485-2-3","stage":2,"title":"썩 · 立刻","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16485-2-3-1","ko":"썩 나오지 못하고 뭐하고 있어?","zh":"怎么还没出来？在干什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"썩","meaning":"立刻，立即","explanation":"썩：立刻，立即","readings":[{"term":"썩","audio":"/audio/84e4384f629fcb173ca0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16485","senseId":"2","lemma":"썩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오지","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못하고","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐하고","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"84e4384f629fcb17","term":"썩","zh":"立刻，立即","audio":"/audio/84e4384f629fcb173ca0.mp3","entryId":"16485","definition":"现在就。","pronunciation":["썩"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term"